:: Act3_School_Pantry {"position":"600,1800","size":"100,100"}
<<nobr>>
<<set $currentLocation to "pantry">>
<<set $activeMap to "Highschool Ground">>
<</nobr>>

<h2>GROUND FLOOR — FOOD PANTRY</h2>

Industrial metal shelves stand behind the canteen kitchen.

<<if not $looted_pantry>>
    You spot unopened crates of bottled water and canned goods tucked behind flour sacks.
    <br><br>
    <div class="choice-menu">
        <button>
            <<link "Search the Pantry shelves">>
                <<addTime 5>>
                <<set $looted_pantry to true>>
                <<run setup.addItem("Bottled Water", 2)>>
                <<run setup.addItem("Canned Food", 1)>>
                <<goto "Act3_School_Pantry">>
            <</link>>
            <span class="btn-sub"><b style="color:var(--accent-gold);">[LOOT]</b> Found 2x Bottled Water, 1x Canned Food.</span>
        </button>
    </div>
<<else>>
    The shelves have been cleared of useful emergency rations.
<</if>>

<br><br>
<div class="choice-menu">
    <button>
        <<link "🚪 Exit Pantry to Canteen [NORTH]">>
            <<goto "Act3_School_Canteen">>
        <</link>>
    </button>
</div>